<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. Pattern reference: https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/blob/481d523374745e77d0cf9c53a4115ab5dd7c8481/apps/v4/examples/base/alert-basic.tsx -->
<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="banner" data-kv-variant="maintenance" data-klic-component="banner" class="kn-banner"><section data-part="banner banner-warning"><i data-part="icon" data-lucide="calendar-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i><header data-part="heading"><strong>정기 점검 안내</strong><p data-part="muted">2026.11.01 · 02:00–03:00 UTC</p></header><p data-part="muted">점검 중 파일 가져오기가 일시 중단됩니다. 문서 읽기는 계속 이용할 수 있습니다.</p><span data-part="badge">약 1시간 예정</span></section></div>
